&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and evolve enterprise pricing frameworks that balance profitability, competitiveness, and customer value across ASO, value-based care, and SaaS-like pricing constructs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
